00:28:12.780 --> 00:28:22.900
waiting there for you so much to see so far to travel so much to learn to know

00:28:24.630 --> 00:28:30.000
friends by your side hopes to hold on to who knows how far you'll

00:28:30.190 --> 00:28:45.240
go to a shining time station where dreams can come true your own imagination waiting there for you
